  "contentHtml": "<p>화학반응식을 왜 배우죠? 라는 질문에</p><p>&#160;</p><p>화학반응식을 통해&#160;</p><p>지구귀환을 할 수 있다!는 수업을 하였습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2230\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2230</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2230\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=IDO&amp;datanum=2230\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2230\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/2230\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에는&#160;</p><p>1. 질량보존의 법칙</p><p>2. 일정성분비의 법칙</p><p>3. 기체반응의 법칙의&#160;</p><p>과학사적 탄생 배경과 의미가 궁금합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>교과서에 있으니까 가르치고 배우는 것이 아닌,</p><p>&#160;</p><p>3가지 법칙의 의미와 가능성을</p><p>중학생들에게&#160;</p><p>이야기해주고 싶습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
